arm64: configs: salami: Add defconfig

From: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>

Consolidated kernel configuration for salami, covering built-in core drivers, Waydroid support, WiFi/modem/cellular paths, debug log readers, crashkernel reservation and board peripherals.

